{
  "v": 1,
  "about": "Golden rows of the v1 seam (seam plan §2.3, §5.1): what v1 posts per S0 topic and kind, and what the hub makes of it. Byte-identical in the hub (services/rooms/test/fixtures) and v1 (test/fixtures); both repos pin its sha256. Regenerated by the hub (test/support/gen-golden.ts); ids, uuids and times are fixed test values.",
